      "writtenOn": "2026-10-27T17:42:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This dependency is required even if bindings-cxx is \u0027auto\u0027. Please pass \u0027required: opt_bindings_cxx\u0027 and disable the bindings if nlohmann-json has not been found (see also my comment on meson.options).",
      "revId": "34475a6245d217a3cff8be093e8ed0e30b901ae3",
